      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506624
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How many the level starts with (it can be more than the maximum count)
    - rid: 552786097007231492
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506625
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: How many are kept in the level (replacing ones that are destroyed or picked up), whatever the maximum count
    - rid: 552786097007231493
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506626
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The most there can be, which only limits the ones added at random
    - rid: 552786097007231494
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506627
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Keeps adding them at random for as long as the level lasts
    - rid: 552786097007231495
