      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506629
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: The chance of adding one at random, at each check (every 15 seconds)
    - rid: 552786097007231497
      type: {class: StringEntry, ns: Unity.Localization, asm: UnityEngine.LocalizationRuntimeModule}
      data:
        m_KeyId: 2151322228506630
        m_Metadata:
          m_Items: []
        m_Value: Ones that aren't there from the start appear anywhere at random. Otherwise, they appear where the level places objects of the type.
